      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Day1Dialogue.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Day2Dialogue.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'FakeSprites.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54bdef151f2ff4a4888b35b71cd401e2, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey... Have you ever heard of the uncanny valley theory?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'The Uncanny valley refers to the fear of things that look human, but
        aren''t '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: Think of... I don't know... A mannequinn perhaps?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: Some say that the reason we have this fear is because...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[4]'
      value: There used to be monsters that dressed up as us long ago
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[5]'
      value: I mean, myths such as the Vampire, Skinwalker and Doppelganger
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[6]'
      value: All Monsters that kill or eat men
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[7]'
      value: Perhaps these myths hold some truth.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[8]'
      value: Maybe these ancient monsters have finally crawled out of hiding
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day1Dialogue.Array.data[9]'
      value: Maybe these ancient monsters have finally crawled out of hiding
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: I was thinking about some stuff last night.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: Maybe these monsters have a more... human origin
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: Whenever a man with enough money wanted to push an agenda
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: The first thing he'd do is pay people to say stuff in his favour online
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[4]'
      value: Obviously, as time passed on, such efforts became automated by machines
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[5]'
      value: But even then, said hypothetical man still cannot reach the outdoors,
        so to speak
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[6]'
      value: Anyone can just unplug and go talk to others in person
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[7]'
      value: And what better way to thwart that then have the automated system
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1176052760742695683, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Day2Dialogue.Array.data[8]'
      value: Mimic Man in person instead of online?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3780991611323433160, guid: d3b636e822bce604282bf47659f5d6cd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: -0.77
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
